// Signing.example.xcconfig
//
// Template for local signing configuration.
//
// Copy this file to `Config/Signing.xcconfig` and fill in your own Apple
// Developer Team ID. That file is gitignored, so your team identifier never
// leaves your machine.
//
//     cp Config/Signing.example.xcconfig Config/Signing.xcconfig
//
// Find your Team ID in Xcode > Settings > Accounts (select your Apple ID, the
// team list shows it), or at developer.apple.com/account under Membership.
//
// Signing this app for a device needs a paid Apple Developer Program
// membership: the Family Controls and NFC Tag Reading capabilities are not
// available to free personal teams.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
